flowchart TD
    A([Student opens exam page]) --> B[POST /student/exams/:id/start]
    B --> C{Allowed?}
    C -->|not enrolled| D[403 not enrolled]
    C -->|exam draft| E[403 not published]
    C -->|window not open| F[403 / waiting page]
    C -->|ok| G[Render question 1]
    G --> H[Edit answer]
    H --> I[15 s autosave timer]
    I --> J[PUT /autosave]
    J --> H
    H --> K{Switch question?}
    K -->|yes| G
    K -->|no| L{Submit?}
    L -->|no| H
    L -->|yes| M[POST /submit answers]
    M --> N{Conflict<br/>already submitted?}
    N -->|yes| O[409, show review]
    N -->|no| P[Server creates submissions,<br/>kicks off graders]
    P --> Q[Notification: submission received]
    Q --> R([end])
    O --> R
